Dear all,

A new manuscript, entitled “Two methods for mapping and visualizing associated data on phylogeny using ggtree”, was accepted to be published on MBE.

As its title indicated, this manuscript introduces two methods for data integration and visualization. You can find the supplemental file on github, https://github.com/GuangchuangYu/plotting_tree_with_data, which IMO is a good resource for learning ggtree.

